        "content": "### Sample sheet\nCopy this Google Sheet as a starting point (a url column and a status column):\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Rcqheojp2cy66kp2aEwb7bU8ByISlZJ4BBVxJsyXi6I/copy"
